      "title": "Stack-based Buffer Overflow in com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-core",
      "description": "Affected versions of com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-core are vulnerable to Stack-based Buffer Overflow. Jackson-core is vulnerable to a denial-of-service attack where an attacker provides a deeply nested input document, triggering a Stackoverflow error during parsing. This flaw can be exploited when processing untrusted data, potentially undermining application availability.",
